    {
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Training history with diagnostics ON / OFF",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Diagnostics OFF:** Grafana itself may be unavailable. Prometheus and Alertmanager remain baseline services; progress, loss samples, checkpoint lineage and security/mutation audit must remain durable. Use authenticated [job history](/api/v1/admin/training/jobs). Select a returned job ID to read `/api/v1/admin/training/jobs/{job_id}/metrics`, `/events` and `/checkpoints`; paginate all results. IDs belong in authorized API history, never metric labels.\n\n**Diagnostics ON:** this dashboard shows aggregates; use local Tempo/Loki for trace/log attribution if those destinations are enabled. Prometheus is not a loss-history database. No data means unknown, not zero or healthy.\n\n**Release status:** 016 and 017 acceptance evidence is recorded in their execution records. Feature 018 full operational qualification is in progress; current component tests do not approve an unmeasured preference profile. [Baseline wiring and gates](/docs/runbooks/sft-training#baseline-wiring)."
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (state) (coire_training_jobs)",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Persisted snapshot gauge; requires scheduler polling task. Distinguish queue reasons in authenticated job detail; event counters are not queue depth.",
      "title": "Training queue and durable states",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
